  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.57,
      401.92,
      285.64
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.57,
      401.9,
      333.64
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Kandyan Marriage andDivorce (Amendment) Act, No. \u2026\u2026. of 2013 and shall bedeemed to have come into operation from January 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.57,
      401.89,
      405.64
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 16 of the Kandyan Marriage and Divorce Act(Chapter 113) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cPrincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (6) thereof, bythe repeal of paragraph (d) of that subsection and thesubstitution therefor of the following paragraph :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      418.57,
      401.89,
      465.64
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(d) shall be accompanied by a receipt issued bythe Divisional Registrar or the District Registrar asthe case may be, in proof of payment of theprescribed fee; and.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      478.57,
      401.89,
      573.64
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 18 of the principal enactment is hereby amendedin subsection (5) thereof, by the substitution for the words\u201cthe declaration shall bear a stamp or stamps of the prescribedvalue which shall be supplied by the party making thedeclaration\u201d of the words \u201cthe declaration shall beaccompanied by a receipt issued by the District Registrar inproof of payment of the prescribed fee which shall be made bythe party making the declaration.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      586.57,
      401.87,
      621.64
    ],
    "text": "4. Section 19 of the principal enactment is hereby amendedby the repeal of subsection (4) of that section and thesubstitution therefor of the following subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      634.57,
      401.9,
      669.64
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(4) Where the declaration is made before theDistrict Registrar or the Divisional Registrar it shallbe accompanied by a receipt issued by the District",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
