    ],
    "text": "5. Section 24 of the principal enactment is hereby amendedby the repeal of subsection (2) of that section and thesubstitution therefor of the following subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
